						Having had their fun, the <<worldMale 'boy' 'girl'>> lets you go, and the room goes back to how it was. You still hear the odd whisper about your unusual size mixed in with the general murmuring between students.
					<<elseif $player.penissize lte 3>>
						The changing room erupts into laughter at your newly exposed <<EZsmall>> <<genitals>>.
						<br><br>

						<<Penisremarkquote>> says one of the <<worldMale 'boys' 'girls'>>, before your arms are released and you quickly clasp your hands over your <<EZsmall>><<if _chastity>> and _chastity<</if>> <<EZpenis>> in shame.
