		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $player.penisExist>>
		<<addinlineevent "schoolChangingRoomBoysEvent">>
			While changing one of your nearby classmates gestures towards <<if _bottomless>>your penis<<else>>the bulge in your <<exposedlower>><</if>>.

